card.statement:
Let $\Tab(w)\in\mathcal{B}(T(\bar{v}))$ and $(r,s,t)\in \Omega^{+}(\Tab(w))$. Set

$$
\mathcal{N}_{(r,s,p)}(\Tab(w)):=\mathcal{N}(\Tab(w))\cup \mathcal{N}(\Tab(w')),$$

where $\Tab(w')$ is any tableau such that $\Omega^{+}(\Tab(w))\setminus\{(r,s,p)\}=\Omega^{+}(\Tab(w'))$. Also, define:

\begin{equation}
\mathcal{N}^{(1)}(\Tab(w)):=
\begin{cases}
\mathcal{N}_{(2,1,1)}(\Tab(w)),& \text{ if } \Tab(w) \text{ is of type } (I)\\
\mathcal{N}(\Tab(w)), & \text{otherwise},
\end{cases}
\end{equation}

\begin{equation}
\mathcal{N}^{(2)}(\Tab(w)):=
\begin{cases}
\mathcal{N}_{(3,i,2)}(\Tab(w)),& \text{ if } \Tab(w) \text{ is of type } (II)_{i}\\
\mathcal{N}(\Tab(w)), & \text{otherwise}.
\end{cases}.
\end{equation}

\begin{equation}
\widehat{\mathcal{A}}(\Tab(w)):=\mathcal{N}^{(1)}(\Tab(w))\cup\mathcal{N}^{(2)}(\Tab(w))
\end{equation}
